/-!
# Finite data for arbitrary elementary subgroups of the native M24 Sylow group

The vertices are all square-one elements, including the identity. Binary tables
record their native indices and point actions, commutation masks, and six large
candidate word lists. Every fact used about these data is checked in Lean.
Source: Aschbacher–Smith H.14.1(1,5), printed pp.396–397.
-/

